<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AIEC 职场软技能</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css?v=2">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <nav class="nav">
                <div class="logo">AIEC 职场软技能</div>
                <div class="nav-links">
                    <a href="index.html">首页</a>
                    <a href="seven-habits.html">七个习惯</a>
                    <a href="skills.html">技能训练</a>
                    <a href="#" onclick="logout()">退出</a>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <section class="habits-section">
            <h2>七个习惯学习体系</h2>
            <p>基于史蒂芬·柯维的经典理论，结合现代职场实战，为你打造完整的个人成长路径</p>
            
            <div class="habits-subsection">
                <h3>个人成功（习惯1-3）</h3>
                <div class="personal-habits">
                    <div class="habit-card">
                        <div class="habit-number">1</div>
                        <h3>积极主动</h3>
                        <p>掌握主动权，对自己的行为和选择负责，成为变化的推动者而非被动接受者</p>
                        <div class="habit-progress">
                            <div class="habit-progress-bar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="habit-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" onclick="startHabitLearning(1)">开始学习</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="habit-card">
                        <div class="habit-number">2</div>
                        <h3>以终为始</h3>
                        <p>明确目标和价值观，以清晰的愿景指导日常行为，确保每一步都朝着正确方向前进</p>
                        <div class="habit-progress">
                            <div class="habit-progress-bar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="habit-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" onclick="startHabitLearning(2)">开始学习</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="habit-card">
                        <div class="habit-number">3</div>
                        <h3>要事第一</h3>
                        <p>优先处理重要而非紧急的事务，通过有效的时间管理实现个人和职业目标</p>
                        <div class="habit-progress">
                            <div class="habit-progress-bar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="habit-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" onclick="startHabitLearning(3)">开始学习</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="habits-subsection">
                <h3>公众成功（习惯4-6）</h3>
                <div class="public-habits">
                    <div class="habit-card">
                        <div class="habit-number">4</div>
                        <h3>双赢思维</h3>
                        <p>寻求互利共赢的解决方案，建立基于信任和合作的人际关系</p>
                        <div class="habit-progress">
                            <div class="habit-progress-bar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="habit-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" onclick="startHabitLearning(4)">开始学习</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="habit-card">
                        <div class="habit-number">5</div>
                        <h3>知彼解己</h3>
                        <p>先理解他人再寻求被理解，通过深度倾听建立有效的沟通桥梁</p>
                        <div class="habit-progress">
                            <div class="habit-progress-bar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="habit-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" onclick="startHabitLearning(5)">开始学习</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="habit-card">
                        <div class="habit-number">6</div>
                        <h3>统合综效</h3>
                        <p>通过团队合作创造1+1>2的效果，发挥集体智慧解决复杂问题</p>
                        <div class="habit-progress">
                            <div class="habit-progress-bar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="habit-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" onclick="startHabitLearning(6)">开始学习</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="habits-subsection">
                <h3>自我更新（习惯7）</h3>
                <div class="renewal-habit">
                    <div class="habit-card">
                        <div class="habit-number">7</div>
                        <h3>不断更新</h3>
                        <p>持续学习和成长，在身体、心智、情感和精神层面不断提升自己，保持长期竞争力</p>
                        <div class="habit-progress">
                            <div class="habit-progress-bar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="habit-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" onclick="startHabitLearning(7)">开始学习</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <script src="js/utils.js"></script>
    <script src="js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>